
@startuml SmartClinic_Appointment_Sequence

title C4 - Умная поликлиника Уровень 4. Диаграмма последовательности. Сценарий: запись пациента на приём

autonumber

actor "Пациент" as Patient
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Appointment Controller" as Controller
participant "Appointment Service" as Service
participant "Patient Service Client" as PatientClient
participant "Patient Service" as PatientService
participant "Booking Policy" as Policy
participant "Availability Service" as Availability
participant "Redis Cache" as Cache
participant "Appointment Repository" as Repository
database "Appointment Database" as DB
participant "Kafka Event Publisher" as Publisher
queue "Apache Kafka" as Kafka

Patient -> Gateway: POST /appointments
Gateway -> Controller: CreateAppointment(request)

Controller -> Service: CreateAppointment(request)

Service -> PatientClient: GetPatient(patientID)
PatientClient -> PatientService: GET /patients/{id}
PatientService --> PatientClient: PatientInfo
PatientClient --> Service: PatientInfo

Service -> Policy: ValidatePatient(patientInfo)
Policy --> Service: Результат проверки

Service -> Availability: CheckAvailability(doctorID, slotID)

Availability -> Cache: Get(slotKey)

alt Слот найден в кэше
    Cache --> Availability: Данные о слоте
else Слот отсутствует в кэше
    Availability -> Repository: GetAvailableSlots(doctorID, date)
    Repository -> DB: SELECT расписания и записей
    DB --> Repository: Данные расписания
    Repository --> Availability: Список слотов
    Availability -> Cache: Set(slotKey, slots)
end

Availability --> Service: Результат проверки

alt Слот недоступен
    Service --> Controller: Ошибка: время занято
    Controller --> Gateway: HTTP 409 Conflict
    Gateway --> Patient: Запись невозможна
else Слот доступен
    Service -> Policy: ValidateBooking(request)
    Policy --> Service: Проверка успешна

    Service -> Repository: Create(appointment)
    Repository -> DB: INSERT appointment
    DB --> Repository: Запись сохранена
    Repository --> Service: Appointment

    Service -> Publisher: Publish(AppointmentCreated)
    Publisher -> Kafka: Publish event
    Kafka --> Publisher: Подтверждение публикации
    Publisher --> Service: Успешно

    Service --> Controller: Appointment
    Controller --> Gateway: HTTP 201 Created
    Gateway --> Patient: Подтверждение записи
end

@enduml
